WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.962
Common table expressions and window functions work especially well together in a multi-stage analytical pipeline.

00:00:06.962 --> 00:00:10.577
One stage can aggregate data to the grain we need.

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:16.562
A second stage can add a ranking or sequence calculation without changing that grain.

00:00:16.562 --> 00:00:20.369
The final query can filter or label the prepared result.

00:00:20.819 --> 00:00:24.086
The advantage is not that the query looks more advanced.

00:00:24.086 --> 00:00:29.117
The advantage is that every stage has a clear purpose and can be checked separately.
